### DURGA API smoke test — VS Code "REST Client" extension
### Run requests top to bottom. @token is captured from the login response.

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@email = smoketest@example.com
@password = pass1234

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Root
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### CORS preflight
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Origin: http://localhost:3000
Access-Control-Request-Method: POST

### Register (rerun with a fresh @email if this 409s)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "full_name": "Smoke Test",
  "phone": "+911234567890"
}

### Register with invalid email — expect 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "not-an-email",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "full_name": "X",
  "phone": "+911234567890"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No auth header — expect 401 + WWW-Authenticate
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contacts

### List contacts (no trailing-slash redirect)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a contact
# @name createContact
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contacts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mummy",
  "phone": "+911111111111",
  "relation": "Mother"
}

###
@contactId = {{createContact.response.body.id}}

### Partial update — only name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/contacts/{{contactId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mummy Updated"
}

### SOS: last (expect null on a fresh account)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos/last
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SOS: trigger
# @name triggerSos
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos/trigger
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": 12.9716,
  "longitude": 77.5946
}

###
@sosId = {{triggerSos.response.body.id}}

### SOS: history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos/history
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SOS: resolve
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sos/{{sosId}}/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Journey: start
# @name startJourney
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journey/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "start_latitude": 12.9716,
  "start_longitude": 77.5946
}

###
@journeyId = {{startJourney.response.body.id}}

### Journey: active
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journey/active
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Journey: stop
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/journey/{{journeyId}}/stop
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Threat: ordinary text — expect Low Risk
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/threat/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "hi"
}

### Threat: high risk keyword
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/threat/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "someone is following me, this is dangerous"
}

### Helplines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/helplines
